Changing the numbering of (e.g.) figures involves two modifications:

-
Redefining whether or not the figure
counter will be reset whenever the chapter/section counter is incremented;

-
Redefining the "appearance" of the figure
counter (\thefigure
), i.e., removing (or adding) the chapter/section prefix.

Standard solution: \counterwithout

